SUMMARY:Coca-Cola Scholars Foundation (General (not field-specific)) due
DESCRIPTION:https://www.coca-colascholarsfoundation.org/apply/\nHigh school seniors graduating during 2026-2027 school year\, currently enrolled in US high school (50 states\, DC\, Puerto Rico\, or select DoD schools)\, US citizen or eligible permanent resident\, minimum 3.0 GPA\, planning to attend accredited US post-secondary institution
URL:https://www.coca-colascholarsfoundation.org/apply/
