DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261105
SUMMARY:Regeneron Science Talent Search (STS) (General (not field-specific)) due
DESCRIPTION:https://www.societyforscience.org/regeneron-sts/\nAny student living in and attending their last year of secondary school in the US and its territories may apply\, regardless of citizenship. US citizens living abroad may also qualify. Students attending American schools abroad who are not US citizens are not eligible.
URL:https://www.societyforscience.org/regeneron-sts/
