SUMMARY:US Senate Youth Program (General (not field-specific)) due
DESCRIPTION:https://ussenateyouth.org/\nRising high school juniors and seniors actively serving in elected or appointed leadership positions representing a constituency in student government\, education\, public affairs\, or community service. Must be enrolled in high school and living in the state they will represent for the entire 2026–2027 academic year.
URL:https://ussenateyouth.org/
END:VEVENT
